        ("Event MCQ: Which property gives the element that triggered the event?", "Option A is correct. event.target is the innermost element that was clicked.", "Easy", "MCQ", "", {"A": "event.target", "B": "event.currentTarget", "C": "event.srcElement", "D": "event.origin"}, "A", "What is event.currentTarget?"),
