        ("How do you set default options for all future AJAX requests in jQuery?", "Use $.ajaxSetup({ headers: { 'Authorization': 'Bearer ' + token } }).", "Intermediate", "Practical", "$.ajaxSetup({\n  headers: { 'X-Requested-With': 'XMLHttpRequest' }\n});", "Why should $.ajaxSetup be used with caution?"),
        ("What are jQuery global AJAX event handlers?", "Global events triggered on document that monitor any AJAX request (e.g. $(document).ajaxStart(), $(document).ajaxStop()).", "Intermediate", "Concept", "$(document).ajaxStart(() => $('#spinner').show());\n$(document).ajaxStop(() => $('#spinner').hide());", "Why are ajaxStart and ajaxStop useful for loading spinners?"),
        ("What is JSONP in jQuery and why was it used?", "JSONP (JSON with Padding) bypassed cross-origin restrictions before CORS existed by injecting a <script> tag that executed a callback function with data.", "Advanced", "Concept", "$.ajax({ url: '...', dataType: 'jsonp' });", "Why is JSONP obsolete today?"),
