        ("How do you convert a jQuery $.get() call into modern native fetch()?", "Replace $.get(url, fn) with fetch(url).then(res => res.json()).then(fn).", "Easy", "Comparison", "// jQuery\n$.getJSON(url, data => console.log(data));\n\n// Modern JS\nfetch(url).then(res => res.json()).then(data => console.log(data));", "Does fetch reject on HTTP 404 or 500?"),
